# Quickstart scenarios (specs/001-auth-dynamic-rbac/quickstart.md).
# Dev seed: business "Demo", branches A and B (active) and C (inactive), users "owner" and "staff"
# (password in appsettings.Development.json, DevSeed section). Business endpoints need a valid
# license in the License settings, otherwise they answer 403 license_invalid.
# Paste ids and tokens from earlier responses into the variables below.

@host = http://localhost:5203
@password = DevOnly-Passw0rd!
@ownerToken = paste-owner-access-token
@staffToken = paste-staff-access-token
@refreshToken = paste-a-refresh-token
@staffProfileId = paste-staff-profile-id
@branchA = paste-branch-a-id
@branchB = paste-branch-b-id
@branchC = paste-branch-c-id
@roleId = paste-role-id
@roleVersion = paste-role-version
@assignmentId = paste-assignment-id
@ownerAssignmentId = paste-owner-assignment-id
@ownerProfileId = paste-owner-profile-id
@otherBusinessRoleId = paste-a-role-id-from-another-business
@businessId = paste-business-id

### 1. Sign in as Owner -> 200, next = portal_selected
POST {{host}}/api/auth/sign-in
Content-Type: application/json

{ "login": "owner", "password": "{{password}}" }

### 2. Wrong password (send 5 times) -> 401 x4, then 423 account_locked
POST {{host}}/api/auth/sign-in
Content-Type: application/json

{ "login": "staff", "password": "wrong" }

### 3a. Renew -> 200 with a new pair
POST {{host}}/api/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{ "refreshToken": "{{refreshToken}}" }

### 3b. Renew again with the SAME token -> 401 refresh_reused, session ended
POST {{host}}/api/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{ "refreshToken": "{{refreshToken}}" }

### 4. Owner creates a role with role.manage only -> 201, addedDependencies = [role.view]
POST {{host}}/api/roles
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Senior Cashier", "permissions": ["role.manage"] }

### 5a. Give it to staff at branch A
POST {{host}}/api/staff/{{staffProfileId}}/role-assignments
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "roleId": "{{roleId}}", "branchId": "{{branchA}}" }

### 5b. Staff lists branches (several -> choose_branch)
GET {{host}}/api/auth/branches
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}

### 5c. Staff selects A, then calls GET /api/roles -> 200; select B and repeat -> 403 permission_denied
POST {{host}}/api/auth/branch
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "branchId": "{{branchA}}" }

###
GET {{host}}/api/roles
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}

### 6. Select inactive branch C -> 403 branch_denied, reason = inactive
POST {{host}}/api/auth/branch
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "branchId": "{{branchC}}" }

### 7. Owner removes role.manage (keeps role.view) -> staff's next manage call is refused within 5 s
PUT {{host}}/api/roles/{{roleId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Senior Cashier", "permissions": ["role.view"], "version": "{{roleVersion}}" }

### 8. Delete a role that is still assigned -> 409 role_in_use with holders
DELETE {{host}}/api/roles/{{roleId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}

### 9. Remove the only Owner assignment -> 409 last_owner
DELETE {{host}}/api/staff/{{ownerProfileId}}/role-assignments/{{ownerAssignmentId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}

### 10. Role of another business -> 404 (audited ACCESS.CROSS_TENANT_DENIED, High)
GET {{host}}/api/roles/{{otherBusinessRoleId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}

### 11. Audit log for the business (needs audit.view)
GET {{host}}/api/audit?code=ROLE.CREATED&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}

### 12. Platform view without a reason -> 400 reason_required (needs a platform admin token)
GET {{host}}/api/platform/businesses/{{businessId}}/audit
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}

### Who am I / sign out
GET {{host}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}

###
POST {{host}}/api/auth/sign-out
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}

### Health (Degraded if audit entries stay unsaved > 5 minutes)
GET {{host}}/health
